  "gaps": "The real building is a sweeping fan of folded copper-pink roof planes over a stepped crescent of pointed cream buttress arches with a tall pointed gable and a slender cross-armed tower; the model is a single gable hall with an aisle row of buttresses, the tower is a plain shaft with a boxy head instead of a cross-shaped head and arrowhead lower collar, and the folded roof and central pyramid with cross are not modelled. OSM outline (stepped, 125 m) is used only for overall extent."
